      "visual_look": "Soft, restorative. Warm Sand and Sage. Feels like a permission slip. Nothing demanding about the design.",
      "caption": "You are not failing at rest. You have been taught to feel guilty for it. Rest is not a reward you earn. Comment SEND IT and I will share more.",
      "hashtags": "#restisproductive #selfhealing #sisterhoodos #nervoussystemhealing #restingwoman #womenswellness",
      "cta": "Comment SEND IT",
      "status": "draft"
